{"chapter": "sets", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "000Q", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$S = \\bigcup_{i \\in I} S_i$", "MATH_0003": "$\\text{size}(S) \\leq \\max\\{|I|, \\sup_i\\{\\text{size}(S_i)\\}\\}$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{sets-lemma-bound-size}\n", "suffix": "\n\\end{lemma}\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:147cb50f24ce788b689ccc9b4b423c3ee4a73a972b3319c93cda4f6a55caa6fd", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cc6ddbdf7c059286176859642cfff9567086896e245167be934291b7a17142e9", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002> be an open covering. Then <MATH_0003>.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9c0567364af814072034a05aa906b669cfb544c27e4be9c5b1670350a8ec59db", "unit_id": "tag:000Q:statement"}
